<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
@page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
{{ css }}
.back {
  width: 210mm; height: 296.5mm; overflow: hidden; position: relative;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 12%, rgba(234, 196, 117, .16), transparent 46%),
    linear-gradient(170deg, #1B2144, #262D59);
  color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.back-inner { text-align: center; max-width: 160mm; }
.back h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 30pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4pt; }
.back .sub { font-family: var(--serif); color: var(--gold-l); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 3pt; margin-top: 6mm; }
.back .line1 { color: #8A94B0; font-size: 9.4pt; margin-top: 9mm; }
.back .line2 { color: #8A94B0; font-size: 9.4pt; margin-top: 2mm; }
.back .gold { width: 14mm; height: 2pt; background: #D9A441; margin: 9mm auto 0; }
.back .fine { color: rgba(138, 148, 176, .85); font-size: 8.5pt; margin-top: 8mm; line-height: 1.9; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="back">
  <div class="back-inner">
    <h1>{{ back.title }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ back.sub }}</div>
    <div class="line1">{{ back.line1 }}</div>
    <div class="line2">{{ back.line2 }}</div>
    <div class="gold"></div>
    <div class="fine">
      本路书由 TripMate 多 Agent 协同旅游规划系统自动汇编，仅供出行参考<br>
      车票 / 酒店 / 门票请在官方渠道完成预订与支付（系统不接触支付）<br>
      天气、路线与价格为生成时点数据，出行前请再次核实
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
